function stopMicCheck(){if(!micTesting)return;micCheckToken++;micTesting=false;voice.stop();$('micCheckBtn').textContent=t('Check microphone ◉');$('micCheckBtn').setAttribute('aria-pressed','false');$('micCheckStatus').textContent='Microphone check stopped.';}
async function toggleMicCheck(){if(micTesting){stopMicCheck();return}if(status!=='setup')return;const token=++micCheckToken;micTesting=true;micLedgers.clear();gameAudio.stop();$('micCheckBtn').textContent=t('Stop microphone check ■');$('micCheckBtn').setAttribute('aria-pressed','true');$('micCheckResult').textContent='';$('micCheckHeard').textContent='Browser heard: —';try{await voice.start(currentSetup().accent);if(token!==micCheckToken)return;$('micCheckStatus').textContent='Listening. Say “four”, “letter B”, or “ninety-eight”.';}catch(err){if(token!==micCheckToken)return;stopMicCheck();$('micCheckStatus').textContent=err.message;}}
function checkMicAnswers(alternatives,meta){let ledger=micLedgers.get(meta.utterance);if(!ledger){ledger=new SpeechLedger();micLedgers.set(meta.utterance,ledger);if(micLedgers.size>40)micLedgers.delete(micLedgers.keys().next().value)}const active=[{id:1,q:{kind:'numbers',answer:'4'}},{id:2,q:{kind:'letters',answer:'B'}},{id:3,q:{kind:'numbers',answer:'98'}}];let best=[];for(const text of alternatives){const matches=ledger.peek(text,active,numberToWords,meta);if(matches.length>best.length)best=matches}if(best.length){ledger.commit(best);$('micCheckResult').textContent=`✓ Matched: ${best.map(m=>m.answer).join(' · ')}. Ready for the swarm!`;}else if(meta.final&&!ledger.consumed.size)$('micCheckResult').textContent='No match yet. Try one target at a time, or change the speech language above.';}
